OL,3,GNEWSAStudent loan staff balloted on    
OL,4,Astrike action                          
OL,6,FStudent Loans Company (SLC) staff are  
OL,7,Fbeing balloted ahead of possible strike
OL,8,Faction over plans for the "outsourcing"
OL,9,Fof 132 jobs at three sites.            
OL,11,FThe SLC has plans to transfer some     
OL,12,Fstaff at its Darlington, Glasgow and   
OL,13,FLlandudno offices to the private       
OL,14,Fcompany Capgemini.                     
OL,16,FThe transfer would be under TUPE       
OL,17,Fregulations which are meant to protect 
OL,18,Fterms, conditions and tasks, but the   
OL,19,FPublic and Commercial Services (PCS)   
OL,20,Funion said it feared several roles     
OL,21,F"could be offshored to India".         
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
